      "content": "but it doesnt feel like a transition. it just feels scary. like i'm standing in a hallway watching the rooms go dark, and i know once the last light goes, there's nothing left of the person i used to be. i'm just tired of being afraid of the dark. i wish i could just... stop the waiting. just turn the lights off myself so i dont have to watch it happen.",
